@If ((Comment4 = "" ) | (Comment4 != "" & ComDate4 != "");""; @Return(@Do(@Command([EditGotoField];"Comment4") ;@Prompt([Ok]; "Missing Value"; "Please fill in all data for Comment 4"))));



FIELD DateReviewed :=@Today;
